==Battleground==
*3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Neko-Musume (Enemy)|Neko-Musume]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Medama-Oyaji (Enemy)|Medama-Oyaji]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Reminder that there is no boss in this stage, so it can be rushed if fast enough. Quick units such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] can help with rushing the stage.

If you aren't able to rush, then hard hitters should work in stage due to [[Neko-Musume (Enemy)|Neko-Musume]] and [[Medama-Oyaji (Enemy)|Medama-Oyaji]] having fairly high HP (105,000 and 245,000 respectively).

